  "bodyHash": "526c9d80c2048bef",
  "content": "\n\n![Banner](https://i.imgur.com/zuMquLR.png)\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img alt=\"GitHub 授權\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/gatekeep06/Cobblenav?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav\"><img alt=\"儲存庫\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/repository-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/wiki\"><img alt=\"維基\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/wiki-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/gatekeep\"><img alt=\"支援%20我\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/support%20me-orange?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&labelColor=black\"></a>\n</center>\n\n# 關於模組\nCobblenav 模組的靈感來自於《寶可夢 綠寶石》與《寶可夢 歐米加紅寶石／阿爾法藍寶石》中的道具及其相關機制。本模組新增了 PokéNav，讓你能夠查詢目前區域可能出現的寶可夢種類、出現機率，以及影響其出現的因素。模組還提供追蹤寶可夢的功能，你可以使用三維箭頭指示或名為 PokéFinder 的雷達道具進行追蹤。該模組正在積極開發中，每月都會新增新功能。\n\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"line\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>指南</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  以下為維基頁面連結，你可以在其中找到關於合成、指令、設定檔以及擴充模組製作的資訊。\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/1.-Recipes\">\n    <img alt=\"合成配方\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zGU6qw1.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/2.-Commands\">\n    <img alt=\"指令\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xE3IoSv.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/3.-Configuration\">\n    <img alt=\"設定\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lJssyXW.png\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/cobblenav/wiki/4.-Add%E2%80%90on-Creation\">\n    <img alt=\"擴充模組\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OZ4Z7Tu.png\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n<br>\n如果你是開發者，可能會對模組提供的 <a href=\"https://github.com/gatekeep06/Cobblenav/wiki\">API 文件</a> 感興趣。\n\n# 功能特色\n\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"line\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>位置畫面</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  PokéNav 會告訴你目前在當前地點可以發現哪些寶可夢。\n  <br>\n  保證精準！\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"位置畫面\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/74I9DRg.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"line\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>搜尋畫面</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  使用 PokéNav 在您的區域尋找最棒的寶可夢！\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"搜尋畫面\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4HfT8SR.png\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>並將其追蹤出來！</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"追蹤畫面\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y9iIKOx.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"line\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LDOW4HM.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>釣魚導航</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  使用 FishingNav 預測你的漁獲！\n  <br>\n  本模組提供獨特的釣魚生成檢查功能。\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"釣魚\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cvKVtqd.png\">\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"釣魚導航\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b9rXJB4.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"line\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>PokéFinder</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  覺得小地圖不公平或不美觀嗎？使用 PokéFinder 吧！\n  <br>\n  透過這台小巧裝置，你就能輕鬆設定並使用雷達功能。\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"PokéFinder\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JC9Uxb9.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"line\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2OBcJj.png\">\n  <b><font size=6>擴充模組相容性</font></b>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  本模組與所有使用 Cobblemon 內建寶可夢生成系統的擴充模組完全相容。<br>不確定傳說寶可夢超夢在哪裡出現？交給 PokéNav 吧！\n</center>\n<br>\n<center>\n  <img alt=\"相容性\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OLf33cj.png\">\n</center>\n\n# 我的其他模組\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobbleboom\">\n  <img width=160 height=160 alt=\"CobbleBoom\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VWlZyEe.png\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-let-me-spawn\">\n  <img width=160 height=160 alt=\"Cobblemon - Let Me Spawn\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VBgXD5r.png\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/neuromon\">\n  <img width=160 height=160 alt=\"Neuromon\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71Kzdpa.png\">\n</a>",
